; Schooner — ported verbatim from FATHOM.EXE main:models3d.js (the `schooner`
; entry). 25 vertices. Sleek light cargo carrier with unequal masts (foremast
; shorter than mainmast), two billowing sails.
;
; AXIS CONVERSION: JS (+Z forward, left-handed) → Godot (-Z forward,
; right-handed). Every JS vertex (x, y, z) becomes (x, y, -z). JS `mastZ`
; in sailDeformations is likewise negated.

